  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are the roots of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> such that <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>, then the number of integral values of <math><mi>x</mi></math> satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "more than <math><mn>2</mn></math>",
