  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are roots of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math> and <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Now, <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />So, there are two integral values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
  }
